080209D0 scene-message-enqueue-return

SceneMessages_Enqueue keeps SceneMessages_FindReceiver result in r0.
Capacity and write operations use r1-r6. SceneMessages_Send forwards it.

The explicit form changed the ROM bytes. The guarded form passed the unit ROM check.

--- a/src/scene_messages.c
+++ b/src/scene_messages.c
@@ -49,4 +49,7 @@
         entry->queue.count[buffer]++;
     }
+#ifdef UBFIX
+    return (int)entry; // r0 retains the receiver lookup result
+#endif
 }
 
